{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t選舉委員會界別分組選舉結果陸續公布，航運交通界17名當選人分別是陳文俊、陳國盛、温子傑、賴永明、黃良柏、李博恩、方智輝、鄭克和、陳智健、張嘉欣、張謙華、何立基、李天柱、吳天海、袁美儀、黃明慈、李鑾輝。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：羅詠暉\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T14:03:54.086299+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T13:29:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T14:57:27.188249+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T13:57:29.185360+00:00","content_hash":"8733caa44d630d495aba93fa02e486eca0a396b7148459e317b24d17be3dad11","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}